<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore parliament to debate budget from July 21.</title>
<headline>Singapore parliament to debate budget from July 21.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's parliament will sit for nine days from July 21 to debate the budget, the clerk of parliament said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Finance Minister Richard Hu presented the budget for 1997/1998 to parliament on Friday.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
